{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"Hold on Tight","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"2aac0fcdc32e701206c5cc1030713336cd33bd0f00fb3357300dd0429a68a2bc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"...I thought we agreed that this was going to be my grand entrance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"You're too slow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The important thing is that we're all safe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We should get moving."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's start heading back down from this building to the east. Reunion won't know where we are."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Are we... safe?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... For now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Your complexion doesn't look too good..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm... a little dizzy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss Misha, how long have you been in Lungmen?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"About... a week."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Just one week...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm... A lot of strange people appeared in the city... and then..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not sure what happened... Everyone started fleeing, so I also..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It was Reunion... Reunion attacked Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Were you... Infected before?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I don't know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"But these last few days, these things... began growing on my leg."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Misha? Misha? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic! Where's the medic squad? !"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]}]}
